{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","descriptor":{"availability":"bundled","byte_size":32768,"locations":["https://archive.org/details/mishnah-avot-classical-edition"],"media_type":"application/json","retrieved_at":"2026-08-28T00:00:00Z","sha256":"pinned-mishnah-pirkei-avot-baseline-v1"},"institution":"mw:institution:hebrew-literature-archive","language":"he","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot","rights":{"attribution":"Classical rabbinic text of Pirkei Avot (Tractate Avot of the Mishnah).","license_expression":"CC0-1.0","redistribution":"permitted","status":"public_domain"}}},"id":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","kind":"source.snapshot","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Pirkei Avot Mishnah Hebrew text and translations artifact"}],"record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"textual":{"delimiter":":","units":["tractate","chapter","mishnah"],"work":"mw:work:mishnah:pirkei-avot"}},"id":"mw:citation-scheme:mishnah:pirkei-avot:tractate-mishnah","kind":"textual.citation_scheme","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Mishnah tractate-chapter-mishnah citation scheme"}],"record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:1:he","language":"en","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:1:1","text":"Moses received the Torah from Sinai and transmitted it to Joshua, Joshua to the elders, the elders to the prophets, and the prophets transmitted it to the men of the Great Assembly. They said three things: Be deliberate in judgment, raise up many disciples, and make a fence around the Torah."}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:1:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"language":"he","representation":"source","script":"Hebr","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:1:1","text":"מֹשֶׁה קִבֵּל תּוֹרָה מִסִּינַי, וּמְסָרָהּ לִיהוֹשֻׁעַ, וִיהוֹשֻׁעַ לִזְקֵנִים, וּזְקֵנִים לִנְבִיאִים, וּנְבִיאִים מְסָרוּהָ לְאַנְשֵׁי כְנֶסֶת הַגְּדוֹלָה. הֵם אָמְרוּ שְׁלֹשָׁה דְבָרִים, הֱווּ מְתוּנִים בַּדִּין, וְהַעֲמִידוּ תַלְמִידִים הַרְבֵּה, וַעֲשׂוּ סְיָג לַתּוֹרָה."}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:1:he","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:1:he","language":"id","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:1:1","text":"Musa menerima Taurat dari Sinai dan meneruskannya kepada Yosua, Yosua kepada para tua-tua, para tua-tua kepada para nabi, dan para nabi meneruskannya kepada para anggota Majelis Agung. Mereka mengatakan tiga hal: Berhati-hatilah dalam penghakiman, bimbinglah banyak murid, dan buatlah pagar di sekeliling Taurat."}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:1:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:14:he","language":"en","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:1:14","text":"He [Hillel] used to say: If I am not for myself, who will be for me? And when I am for myself alone, what am I? And if not now, when?"}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:14:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"language":"he","representation":"source","script":"Hebr","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:1:14","text":"הוּא הָיָה אוֹמֵר, אִם אֵין אֲנִי לִי, מִי לִי. וּכְשֶׁאֲנִי לְעַצְמִי, מָה אֲנִי. וְאִם לֹא עַכְשָׁיו, אֵימָתָי."}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:14:he","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:14:he","language":"id","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:1:14","text":"Ia [Hillel] biasa berkata: Jika aku bukan untuk diriku sendiri, siapakah yang akan ada untukku? Dan bila aku hanya untuk diriku sendiri, apakah artiku? Dan bila tidak sekarang, kapan lagi?"}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:14:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:2:he","language":"en","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:1:2","text":"Simeon the Righteous was one of the remnants of the Great Assembly. He used to say: On three things the world stands: on the Torah, on the Temple service, and on acts of loving-kindness."}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:2:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"language":"he","representation":"source","script":"Hebr","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:1:2","text":"שִׁמְעוֹן הַצַּדִּיק הָיָה מִשְּׁיָרֵי כְנֶסֶת הַגְּדוֹלָה. הוּא הָיָה אוֹמֵר, עַל שְׁלֹשָׁה דְבָרִים הָעוֹלָם עוֹמֵד, עַל הַתּוֹרָה וְעַל הָעֲבוֹדָה וְעַל גְּמִילוּת חֲסָדִים."}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:2:he","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:2:he","language":"id","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:1:2","text":"Simon yang Benar adalah salah satu sisa-sisa anggota Majelis Agung. Ia biasa berkata: Dunia berdiri di atas tiga pilar: di atas Taurat, di atas peribadatan (pelayanan), dan di atas perbuatan kasih sayang."}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:1:2:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:2:1:he","language":"en","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:2:1","text":"Rabbi [Judah the Prince] said: Which is the right path that a person should choose for oneself? Whatever is praiseworthy to the one who does it and brings honor from others..."}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:2:1:en","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"language":"he","representation":"source","script":"Hebr","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:2:1","text":"רַבִּי אוֹמֵר, אֵיזוֹהִי דֶרֶךְ יְשָׁרָה שֶׁיָּבֹר לוֹ הָאָדָם, כֹּל שֶׁהִיא תִפְאֶרֶת לְעוֹשֶׂיהָ וְתִפְאֶרֶת לוֹ מִן הָאָדָם..."}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:2:1:he","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
{"extensions":{"source":{"artifact":"mw:artifact:mishnah:pirkei-avot-baseline","provenance":"mw:provenance:mishnah:pirkei-avot"},"textual":{"derived_from":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:2:1:he","language":"id","representation":"translation","script":"Latn","target":"mw:passage:mishnah:avot:2:1","text":"Rabi [Yehuda sang Pangeran] berkata: Manakah jalan lurus yang patut dipilih seseorang untuk dirinya? Apa pun yang menjadi kehormatan bagi yang melakukannya dan mendatangkan pujian dari sesama manusia..."}},"id":"mw:content:mishnah:avot:2:1:id","kind":"textual.content","record_type":"resource"}
